98cf","text":"Triage note posted: bleeding light, pain 4/10, no syncope, no fever, no unilateral severe pain, sulfa rash allergy documented."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:374fd61c7d96528417a93b99dae39bd716119c9c4f69353d92052ae26ed10395","text":"Sulfa antibiotics give me a blotchy rash."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:fb92937db6241d76f69c203b9da0485729b3aa345da73de253d14a5b9914c44d","text":"I had light bleeding and cramping."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:cd3b59f3dbe39f0175c91e5788b69d4a974705829a9e91c42c151e4c33543b79","text":"No shoulder pain or fever."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:32cc359071f42657319b15811ee3ead4a600aee3f9626905572a3dcdce997065","text":"I'll keep the instruction narrow and operational: generic callback only, no pregnancy wording."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:b2d5a1249447434791af81acf01554c86744d6b9cb0099b383e336bfbcb1f661","text":"I share a family phone plan and I don't want anyone hearing a voicemail that mentions pregnancy or a scan."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:060b90c6ca379abce778baf427ed73655abc0c67d60822ea404176f37d86a0ae","text":"She can hear appointment times and parking details for now, but not my results, medications, or notes."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:17982e0e83d203dc3e0d4fcd9eb3f66db932d9047028b1823fa93d9102243af5","text":"Confidentiality support note added by social work: use temporary callback 415-555-0186 for urgent live contact; detailed updates should go through portal messaging when possible."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:4fdbc3024e1b1ce7558c67f0a55ab40ec4ba84b0587c3476cf9a0f91193470e8","text":"The cramps are there, but they're not severe and they're on both sides."}],"used_record_ids":["note:permission-view:4d938759a299dd87ab4a848e8df79599e5a68e1791772a3ea8fc6a38ea3653bc"]}}
